- espressif/qrcode includes qrcodegen.c, Copyright (c) Project Nayuki, MIT licence
  (https://www.nayuki.io/page/qr-code-generator-library).
- espressif/esp_new_jpeg 1.0.2: ESPRESSIF MIT License, Copyright (c) 2024 Espressif Systems (Shanghai) Co., Ltd.
